      "widgets_values": [
        "# TRELLIS.2 multi-view model-sheet input\n\nLoad separate images for Camera 000° (front), 090° (left), and 180° (rear). Keep pose, scale, centerline, lighting, and canvas dimensions consistent.\n\nEach view is background-cleaned independently, encoded independently by DINOv3, and combined as one ordered conditioning context. Do not use a flattened contact sheet here; keep that artifact for human review only.\n\nThe 270° input remains optional on the generation node for the next experiment."
